<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ROSS Technology cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ROSS Technology cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst John Lazlo downgraded ROSS Technology Inc to neutral from attractive, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for details.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1-3/4 to 6-3/8 after the company said it expected second-quarter operating results to be lower than analysts' expectations.</p>
</text>
